"`What kind of charm?`" she asked, "`the lucky
one`", then she wrote `"`foo`"` on the "`Python~~3`" and
"`call `f x` now`" boards, but not on x"`y`"z or a;"`b`".
---
“What kind of charm?” she asked, “the lucky one”, then she wrote
`"`foo`"` on the “Python 3” and “call `f x` now” boards, but not on
x"`y`"z or a;"`b`".
